{"path":"chrono/month/operator_arith_2","title":"std::chrono::operator+, std::chrono::operator- (std::chrono::month)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::</span>operator+, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::</span>operator- <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::chrono::month)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/month/operator_arith_2","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"As long as the computation doesn't overflow, (1-3) always return a valid month even if m.ok() is false.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/chrono\">&lt;chrono&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2621\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month</span></span></a> operator<span class=\"sy2\">+</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2621\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> m,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">months</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> ms <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2621\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month</span></span></a> operator<span class=\"sy2\">+</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">months</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> ms,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2621\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> m <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2621\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month</span></span></a> operator<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2621\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> m, <br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">months</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> ms <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_4\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">months</span></span></a> operator<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2621\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> m1, <br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2621\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> m2 <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (4) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1,2)</span> Adds <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ms.<span class=\"me1\">count</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> months to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">m</span></code>. The month value held in the result is computed by first evaluating <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">static_cast</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">long</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>m<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>ms.<span class=\"me1\">count</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, reducing it modulo 12 to an integer in the range <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">11</span></span></code><code>]</code></span>, and then adding 1.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Subtracts <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ms.<span class=\"me1\">count</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> months from <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">m</span></code> and returns the result. Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> m <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span>ms<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">m1.<span class=\"me1\">ok</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">m2.<span class=\"me1\">ok</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> are both <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, returns a <span class=\"t-lc\">std::chrono::months</span> value <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">m</span></code> such that <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">m.<span class=\"me1\">count</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is in the range <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">11</span></span></code><code>]</code></span> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">m2 <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> m <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> m1</span></code>. Otherwise the returned value is unspecified.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1-3)</span> A <span class=\"t-lc\">std::chrono::month</span> holding a month value calculated as described above.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> A <span class=\"t-lc\">std::chrono::months</span> representing the distance between <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">m1</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">m2</span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>As long as the computation doesn't overflow, <span class=\"t-v\">(1-3)</span> always return a valid month even if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">m.<span class=\"me1\">ok</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>The result of subtracting two <code>month</code> values is a duration of type <span class=\"t-lc\">std::chrono::months</span>. That duration unit represents the length of the average Gregorian month, and the resulting duration bears no relationship to the number of days in the particular months represented by the operands. For example, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1001\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">seconds</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2625\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">April</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2624\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">March</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is not the number of seconds in March (<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">2678400s</span></code>), but <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">2629746s</span></code> (30.436875 days).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2621\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month</span></span></a> m<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">6</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    m <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> m <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">months</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>m <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2621\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    m <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> m <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">months</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>m <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2621\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">months</span></span></a> ms <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2621\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2621\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">6</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>ms <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">months</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month/operator_inc_dec\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator++</span><span>operator++<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(int)</span></span><span>operator--</span><span>operator--<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(int)</span></span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  increments or decrements the month <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month/operator_arith\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator+=</span><span>operator-=</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  adds or subtracts a number of months <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/month","title":"std::chrono::month"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::chrono::operator+, std::chrono::operator- (std::chrono::month)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"4 declarations; revisions: since C++20. Adds ms.count() months to m."},{"label":"Return value","note":"A std::chrono::month holding a month value calculated as described above."},{"label":"Notes","note":"As long as the computation doesn't overflow, (1-3) always return a valid month even if m.ok() is false."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator++, operator++(int), operator--, …","note":"increments or decrements the month"},{"label":"operator+=, operator-=","note":"adds or subtracts a number of months"}]}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":317,"codeBlockCount":1}
